{"4333680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DreeM Ascension", "steam_appid": 4333680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333680/extras/c34f376de90a2c4e92b3b18f8fbf375f.avif?t=1788239302\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333680/extras_big/c34f376de90a2c4e92b3b18f8fbf375f.avif?t=1788239302 width=1560 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DreeM Ascension is a short survival horror first person shooter adventure that takes place inside the DreeMScape VR simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Sightseer, you look just like everybody else in a corrupted simulated world bigger than you can imagine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just be careful, traversing too deep into the Darklands might lead you into trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333680/extras/7b1abf1f4e9eda6946b512a8a83dfb36.avif?t=1788239302\" width=1560 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an open world driven by fear and dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other sightseers, chat with them, and help them out for rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play arcade games, discover hidden areas, and destroy decoration for coins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a consumer and buy stuff in the shop to protect yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight creatures that have breached out of the arcade games they came from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find notes scattered throughout the Darklands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333680/extras/c0940b768dda86111c15107de7ca9a45.avif?t=1788239302\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333680/extras_big/c0940b768dda86111c15107de7ca9a45.avif?t=1788239302 width=1560 height=406 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>and much.. much more!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">That's not all DreeM Ascension has to offer, but we can't spoil it all, you're going to have to take our word for it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">What are you waiting for? See you inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find me.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333680/extras/c34f376de90a2c4e92b3b18f8fbf375f.avif?t=1788239302\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333680/extras_big/c34f376de90a2c4e92b3b18f8fbf375f.avif?t=1788239302 width=1560 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DreeM Ascension is a short survival horror first person shooter adventure that takes place inside the DreeMScape VR simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Sightseer, you look just like everybody else in a corrupted simulated world bigger than you can imagine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just be careful, traversing too deep into the Darklands might lead you into trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333680/extras/7b1abf1f4e9eda6946b512a8a83dfb36.avif?t=1788239302\" width=1560 height=406 /></span></p